> User dl0478 (284081)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":148,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":26702,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1407269,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":220521,"Name":"Brenners","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220521.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1298839686,"LastPoster":{"Id":282964,"Name":"samwillow","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282964.jpg?_r=1431149209","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":93,"Preview":{"Id":1901211,"PostDate":1437956851,"PostContent":"Its really nice idea of not posting on Facebook. Even I don't like sharing all my special moments...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stevenharris1245@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.80.179.216","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437956357,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"AbigelLuis","Id":284154,"Name":"AbigelLuis","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.174.77.34","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59930,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8f24d4dc5140782e49c26e70a5091d87","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Sorry @[member=\"BusyBee280\"]!! I forget only Canada has tooneys. It&#039;s a $2 coin! So all drinks cost the guests $2. If you think of how many shots are in a 40 of hard alcohol, x $2 per shot, it should generally pay for itself. (Give or take&amp;nbsp;all the mix ins and cups and what not).&amp;nbsp;I have&amp;nbsp;a lot of guests that heavily drink, so an open bar was just not an option for us. I know when I go to a wedding that has $2 drinks, I am more than happy with that price. :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;and @[member=\"stefadile\"] - I don&#039;t think it looks cheap at all to not offer an open bar. Every now and then we go to a wedding that has a open bar, but it is generally always paid for by the parents or something. To fund free alcohol for all yours guests, all night, yourselves, is a huge extra cost to the wedding! Not to mention how much get&#039;s wasted when its \"free\". People grab 2 at a time, the ice melts, they toss it and go grab another one. Plus people go overboard and then they&#039;re all a drunk mess. I would suggest just having a cheaper bar, such as $2 a drink or something. (or 2 free and the rest full price or something like that)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1853276,"PostDate":1401708055,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Sorry @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277733\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277733-busybee280\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">BusyBee280<\/span><\/a>!! I forget only Canada has tooneys. It's a $2 coin! So all drinks cost the guests $2. If you think of how many shots are in a 40 of hard alcohol, x $2 per shot, it should generally pay for itself. (Give or take\u00a0all the mix ins and cups and what not).\u00a0I have\u00a0a lot of guests that heavily drink, so an open bar was just not an option for us. I know when I go to a wedding that has $2 drinks, I am more than happy with that price. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<br \/><p>and @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"274502\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/274502-stefadile\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">stefadile<\/span><\/a> - I don't think it looks cheap at all to not offer an open bar. Every now and then we go to a wedding that has a open bar, but it is generally always paid for by the parents or something. To fund free alcohol for all yours guests, all night, yourselves, is a huge extra cost to the wedding! Not to mention how much get's wasted when its \"free\". People grab 2 at a time, the ice melts, they toss it and go grab another one. Plus people go overboard and then they're all a drunk mess. I would suggest just having a cheaper bar, such as $2 a drink or something. (or 2 free and the rest full price or something like that)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nikkicraig10@gmail.com","IpAddress":"204.174.77.34","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395764738,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nikkicraig10","Id":277331,"Name":"nikkicraig10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.226.199.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59930,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c4dbaa69cc15dfac12a9c59c281920a8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have left the planning of the AHR to my FI because I am currently planning my own DW as well as my sister&#039;s DW. He is looking at either a club or the church hall. Alcohol will be $2\/drink, we are providing catered appies and dessert, and Since FI is a dj and has tons of dj friends\/family there will be a dj. We will be having my son nephew taking the pictures (I think) and hoping to keep this all under $2000.00. We will probably be doing this closer to christmas as we are getting married in Oct 2015.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1857288,"PostDate":1403978369,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have left the planning of the AHR to my FI because I am currently planning my own DW as well as my sister's DW. He is looking at either a club or the church hall. Alcohol will be $2\/drink, we are providing catered appies and dessert, and Since FI is a dj and has tons of dj friends\/family there will be a dj. We will be having my son nephew taking the pictures (I think) and hoping to keep this all under $2000.00. We will probably be doing this closer to christmas as we are getting married in Oct 2015.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"spadeincwedding@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.226.206.246","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1396387780,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"NixSpade","Id":277449,"Name":"NixSpade","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.251.90.66","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59930,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d716dca12fc47edd07fa552aeeaefe79","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;we really went (and continue to) go back and forth on this...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;1. we are spending as little as possible! we want our lives together to be where th money goes, not one or two days. but enough to be confortable.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;2. Since my vote for a winery\/brewery got axed b\/c its 1500$ and yo uhave to do everyhting... were doing a 100$ banquet hall, my moms friend is bartending, and were making an ipod playlist. so its pretty informal, but i made the dress a resort formal, I want to wear my dress for some of it, and I want other to wear nice clothes, no jeans! :) the good thing about the hall is we dont have a time limit, so we&#039;re doing 5pm till.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;3. Our wedding is April 16, our AHR is May 16.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;4. We&#039;re doing tables with small meals, like burger and pulled pork sliders, pasta, potatoes, small meals and snacky food. we&#039;re also doing a smoores bar (my new last name will be moore).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;5. I am going to start in my dress, then change later. I am leaving the FH up to him.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;6. We&#039;re doing notecard invites (vistaprint so I can design them, but don&#039;t have to print and cut them, I am doing what they call \"notecard\"). Then I&#039;ll stick them inenvelopes, but no RSVP needed.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;7. no photographer, we have a lot of cameras in the families.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;8. we&#039;re doing a cake top and a cupcake tower&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;9. Decorations. We&#039;re doing chalkboard labels for everything, included in a sign for the dance floor \"&#039;trust me you can dance&#039; -Vodka\"&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;10. we&#039;re doing a banquet hall, so its just white (my FH won that battle because its 1400$ cheaper than where I wanted). So we&#039;re lining the walls with pictures in chronological order, him on one side me on the other, leading up to the tv that will play our wedding day and pics.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1861579,"PostDate":1406044756,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>we really went (and continue to) go back and forth on this...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>1. we are spending as little as possible! we want our lives together to be where th money goes, not one or two days. but enough to be confortable.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>2. Since my vote for a winery\/brewery got axed b\/c its 1500$ and yo uhave to do everyhting... were doing a 100$ banquet hall, my moms friend is bartending, and were making an ipod playlist. so its pretty informal, but i made the dress a resort formal, I want to wear my dress for some of it, and I want other to wear nice clothes, no jeans! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> the good thing about the hall is we dont have a time limit, so we're doing 5pm till.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>3. Our wedding is April 16, our AHR is May 16.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>4. We're doing tables with small meals, like burger and pulled pork sliders, pasta, potatoes, small meals and snacky food. we're also doing a smoores bar (my new last name will be moore).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>5. I am going to start in my dress, then change later. I am leaving the FH up to him.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>6. We're doing notecard invites (vistaprint so I can design them, but don't have to print and cut them, I am doing what they call \"notecard\"). Then I'll stick them inenvelopes, but no RSVP needed.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>7. no photographer, we have a lot of cameras in the families.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>8. we're doing a cake top and a cupcake tower<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>9. Decorations. We're doing chalkboard labels for everything, included in a sign for the dance floor \"'trust me you can dance' -Vodka\"<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>10. we're doing a banquet hall, so its just white (my FH won that battle because its 1400$ cheaper than where I wanted). So we're lining the walls with pictures in chronological order, him on one side me on the other, leading up to the tv that will play our wedding day and pics.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"becassidy@ymail.com","IpAddress":"151.151.109.15","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1392737096,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"becassidy","Id":276764,"Name":"becassidy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.213.47.20","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59930,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a7315cc862f2631d57f92545c2e7e1b5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I love this thread! It is helping me get some ideas for things I&#039;ve been struggling with for our AHR!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;1. As cheap as possible, hopefully under $2000&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;2. Semi-formal&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;3. Just under a month after we return&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;4. Undecided. Maybe a little Jamaican twist somewhere in there since we&#039;re getting married in Jamaica?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;5. I&#039;ll wear my wedding dress at least for the first part. Then, maybe change in to something easier to dance in?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;6. NO IDEA?!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;7. I&#039;m hoping a friend who is starting out in her photography business can give us a deal. I&#039;d like to capture some of the celebration.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;8. Undecided. I&#039;m considering making my own since I love to bake and it would be cheaper.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;9. Also undecided. Strands of lights. Im thinking eclectic and mismatched to go along with our bohemian beach wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;10. I think we will play our wedding video and maybe do a slideshow of pictures from our trip.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878327,"PostDate":1415890956,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I love this thread! It is helping me get some ideas for things I've been struggling with for our AHR!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>1. As cheap as possible, hopefully under $2000<\/p>\n<p>2. Semi-formal<\/p>\n<p>3. Just under a month after we return<\/p>\n<p>4. Undecided. Maybe a little Jamaican twist somewhere in there since we're getting married in Jamaica?<\/p>\n<p>5. I'll wear my wedding dress at least for the first part. Then, maybe change in to something easier to dance in?<\/p>\n<p>6. NO IDEA?!<\/p>\n<p>7. I'm hoping a friend who is starting out in her photography business can give us a deal. I'd like to capture some of the celebration.<\/p>\n<p>8. Undecided. I'm considering making my own since I love to bake and it would be cheaper.<\/p>\n<p>9. Also undecided. Strands of lights. Im thinking eclectic and mismatched to go along with our bohemian beach wedding.<\/p>\n<p>10. I think we will play our wedding video and maybe do a slideshow of pictures from our trip.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aricalizx3@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.213.47.20","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415706284,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Jamaica2016","Id":281097,"Name":"Jamaica2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.53.250.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59930,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9b6193089b2b8264dd26b2a0a804800b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m having my AHR the weekend after we get back from Cancun (ambitious, I know!) on a Sunday afternoon because it was WAY cheaper than Fridays or Saturdays, probably from 1-4. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m going to be wearing my dress again after reading awesome posts on here about how so many other brides are doing it, cause HECK YEAH I want to wear it again!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Is it weird to have a DJ\/Dancing during daylight hours? &amp;nbsp;When I originally booked it it was going to be really casual, thus the afternoon timeframe, but now that I know I want to wear my dress again, I think I might make it a little more formal. &amp;nbsp;Should I push back the timeframe into the evening, or is that inconvenient on a Sunday?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879563,"PostDate":1417616811,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm having my AHR the weekend after we get back from Cancun (ambitious, I know!) on a Sunday afternoon because it was WAY cheaper than Fridays or Saturdays, probably from 1-4. \u00a0I'm going to be wearing my dress again after reading awesome posts on here about how so many other brides are doing it, cause HECK YEAH I want to wear it again!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Is it weird to have a DJ\/Dancing during daylight hours? \u00a0When I originally booked it it was going to be really casual, thus the afternoon timeframe, but now that I know I want to wear my dress again, I think I might make it a little more formal. \u00a0Should I push back the timeframe into the evening, or is that inconvenient on a Sunday?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rachelia160@aim.com","IpAddress":"66.61.104.237","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1388717497,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275855.jpg?_r=1435853657","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rachelia160","Id":275855,"Name":"rachelia160","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.21.46.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59930,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9276c1c2fffa04e007c3679b0adfbc2c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Here are my answers:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;1. We want to keep it to $3,000-$3,500 tops. We included this in our wedding budget.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;2. It will informal. It&#039;s a Saturday brunch that is 4 hours. We will not be doing a dance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;3. Our AHR is about 6 weeks after our wedding.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;4. Passed hors d&#039;ouvres and a buffet&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;5. I bought a white dress. It&#039;s not a wedding dress of any kind though. My FI will probably wear the tie he wears at our wedding.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;6. We made invitations on Vistaprint. They&#039;re nice but nothing fancy.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;7. We hired a photographer, but he&#039;s a guy I work with and is really cheap.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;8. A cake is part of the package we bought, but it&#039;s not a wedding cake. It&#039;s a sheet cake.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;9. Our venue has a very victorian, rustic look to it so we&#039;ve matched that. We will have mason jars with flowers on each table along with a burlap table runner that has lace on it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;10. We will display photos. The venue has a flat screen so we can rotate them, but there won&#039;t be any sort of formal presentation. We&#039;ll also buy some picture frames and put pictures along the bar.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896376,"PostDate":1431681474,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Here are my answers:\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>1. We want to keep it to $3,000-$3,500 tops. We included this in our wedding budget.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>2. It will informal. It's a Saturday brunch that is 4 hours. We will not be doing a dance.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>3. Our AHR is about 6 weeks after our wedding.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>4. Passed hors d'ouvres and a buffet\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>5. I bought a white dress. It's not a wedding dress of any kind though. My FI will probably wear the tie he wears at our wedding.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>6. We made invitations on Vistaprint. They're nice but nothing fancy.<\/p>\n<p>7. We hired a photographer, but he's a guy I work with and is really cheap.<\/p>\n<p>8. A cake is part of the package we bought, but it's not a wedding cake. It's a sheet cake.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>9. Our venue has a very victorian, rustic look to it so we've matched that. We will have mason jars with flowers on each table along with a burlap table runner that has lace on it.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>10. We will display photos. The venue has a flat screen so we can rotate them, but there won't be any sort of formal presentation. We'll also buy some picture frames and put pictures along the bar.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"robynbrooke81@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.99.18.219","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403532989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278661.jpg?_r=1404161707","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jeffandrobyn","Id":278661,"Name":"jeffandrobyn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.80.179.216","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59930,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1bec5c428805a93cfca99857e316a773","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Its really nice idea of not posting on Facebook. Even I don&#039;t like sharing all my special moments on Facebook.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901211,"PostDate":1437956851,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Its really nice idea of not posting on Facebook. Even I don't like sharing all my special moments on Facebook.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stevenharris1245@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.80.179.216","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437956357,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"AbigelLuis","Id":284154,"Name":"AbigelLuis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"114.121.134.202","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59930,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7a35237d14b8e4e4c41957e579360590","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;i think it&#039;s more easy to make the wedding in another place.. not at home. your home will be so messy&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901787,"PostDate":1438672045,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>i think it's more easy to make the wedding in another place.. not at home. your home will be so messy<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samwillow39@gmail.com","IpAddress":"114.121.164.128","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430650422,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282964.jpg?_r=1431149209","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"samwillow","Id":282964,"Name":"samwillow","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"59930","Title":"At Home Reception (AHR) Do's and Don'ts","LastPostDate":1438672045},"Pages":{"TotalItems":148,"TotalPages":15,"CurrentPage":140,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":130,"LastPage":140},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
