> Time: 1439314359 / Tue, 11 Aug 2015 17:32:39 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=79063&start=10&SessionId=f2a1d0b8db9ee24d32231e1fc3a7d0d7
> User kuoling (282701)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.228.60.204","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79063,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"14c10f08d51b0bb60135247cd2dab4ac","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Katie,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congrats on your engagement. Yes, a symbolic wedding is much cheaper and much less stressful than a legal one.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think getting married 3 days after your scheduled arrival date is ideal. This way, you get one day to get on the resort, another to check out the venue, marry on the third, and then your group gets to relax and enjoy the rest of their time after.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It sounds like you&#039;re doing a lot on your own (trying to contact the resorts, compare hotels, and compare ceremony types). Your best bet is to find a good TA who does a lot of wedding groups. You can get lots of suggestions here. Mine is really good. Let me know if you want me to forward her contacts.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895148,"PostDate":1430535515,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Katie,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats on your engagement. Yes, a symbolic wedding is much cheaper and much less stressful than a legal one.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think getting married 3 days after your scheduled arrival date is ideal. This way, you get one day to get on the resort, another to check out the venue, marry on the third, and then your group gets to relax and enjoy the rest of their time after.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It sounds like you're doing a lot on your own (trying to contact the resorts, compare hotels, and compare ceremony types). Your best bet is to find a good TA who does a lot of wedding groups. You can get lots of suggestions here. Mine is really good. Let me know if you want me to forward her contacts.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"theniylife@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.228.60.204","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430534280,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"1weddingirl","Id":282948,"Name":"1weddingirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79063,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"978620dfdf6aa0a757f0a9e29c56e0de","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Yes, a symbolic ceremony is cheaper than a legal one in Mexico! By about $1000 where we are getting married.&amp;nbsp; I didn&#039;t know it was an option either until I started researching :)\n\n\nI&#039;m getting married April 2016!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895287,"PostDate":1430758758,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Yes, a symbolic ceremony is cheaper than a legal one in Mexico! By about $1000 where we are getting married.\u00a0 I didn't know it was an option either until I started researching <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nI'm getting married April 2016!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katie_mcbride48@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424114250,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282132.jpg?_r=1437519508","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"KatieMcBride","Id":282132,"Name":"KatieMcBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.23.195.134","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79063,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"86f9aab535cb4d4ba415c6e68fca0fb0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Louisex82x\" post=\"1895022\" timestamp=\"1430476011\"]\nHi Katie,\n\nThanks for your reply.\n\nWe are planning a legal ceremony over there but I have been reading more about people getting married legally at home and then having a symbolic ceremony once in Mexico and didn&#039;t know you could even do that until recently.\n\nDoes it work out cheaper if you do it that way round or is it just the same?\n\nI have spoken again to the hotel and they have confirmed that it is 3 full days!\n\nWhen do you get married?\n\nRegards\n\nLouise[\/quote]\nHi and congrats on your engagement! We did a symbolic ceremony in Mexico than doing a legal. It saved us an additional $1500 and we arrived 2 days before the ceremony. We legally got married 3 days before we left for Mexico. It felt so much more surreal and romantic when we had our wedding in Mexico.","Attachments":[],"Id":1895369,"PostDate":1430837351,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Louisex82x, on 01 May 2015 - 02:26 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Katie,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks for your reply.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are planning a legal ceremony over there but I have been reading more about people getting married legally at home and then having a symbolic ceremony once in Mexico and didn't know you could even do that until recently.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Does it work out cheaper if you do it that way round or is it just the same?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have spoken again to the hotel and they have confirmed that it is 3 full days!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>When do you get married?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Regards<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Louise<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi and congrats on your engagement! We did a symbolic ceremony in Mexico than doing a legal. It saved us an additional $1500 and we arrived 2 days before the ceremony. We legally got married 3 days before we left for Mexico. It felt so much more surreal and romantic when we had our wedding in Mexico.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><strong>N&C<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><em>April 17, 2015<\/em><\/p>\n<p>Gran Caribe Real (Cancun, Mexico)<\/p>\n<p>Including Bride & Groom: 22 guests (19 adults & 3 children)","Email":"nancysoup@att.net","IpAddress":"216.23.195.134","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411661062,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280004.jpg?_r=1412891058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hellosassypants","Id":280004,"Name":"hellosassypants","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"109.152.24.32","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79063,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"11303ef4e661291fd48d30e92dc6dbda","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi and thank you for your reply,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congrats to you and your hubby on your recent wedding!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We have been thinking a lot about it and decided to do the civil ceremony in Mexico.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The main reason being as we want to be legally married on the day of exchanging our vows etc.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Our next decision is whether to have a beach wedding or gazebo!! so much to think of and this is just for starters!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Louise&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895605,"PostDate":1431001927,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi and thank you for your reply,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats to you and your hubby on your recent wedding!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We have been thinking a lot about it and decided to do the civil ceremony in Mexico.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The main reason being as we want to be legally married on the day of exchanging our vows etc.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Our next decision is whether to have a beach wedding or gazebo!! so much to think of and this is just for starters!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Louise<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dylan2908@talktalk.net","IpAddress":"109.152.26.99","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430390361,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Louisex82x","Id":282916,"Name":"Louisex82x","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":14,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
